  "title": "APU inoperative, MEL-deferrable, hot day",
  "narrative": "Malaga, 37 °C. AX-AGA, an A320, is on stand 21 for ACX721 to Manchester at 14:40 with 178 passengers. The APU will not start: APU FAULT on the ECAM. Without the APU there is no cabin cooling on stand and engine start needs external air; the handler has no air-conditioning unit free. The handler supervisor pushes for the APU to be \"deferred in the system\" straight away to make the slot. The APU may be MEL-deferrable, but only a certifying engineer can decide that after troubleshooting. A contracted B1 engineer can be on stand in about 20 minutes.",
