    "referenceSummary": "Resist the pressure: the APU may be MEL-deferrable (cite the MEL item and its conditions) but only the certifying engineer decides, after troubleshooting; software never defers. Page the contracted B1 immediately, keep passengers off a hot aircraft or get cooling (ACU or GPU), look after heat-sensitive PRM passengers and families with water and early information, and plan an air-start for engine start. Record the human decision when it is taken."
